/-- The `challenge` equation. go-nitro ForceMove.sol:39-81 `challenge`.

    Every state: an operation equation states what `apply` does in every state of its type; the adversary may submit any call in any state (armada-laconic docs/process.md R.2). -/
def Spec.apply_challenge_equation : Prop :=
  ∀ (apps : Apps E) (caller : Participant) (c : FixedPart)
